docs {
  Google redirects the staff member's browser here after consent - not
  meant to be called directly. Forwards `code` unchanged to
  ADMIN_FRONTEND_URL as a redirect; never touches the database itself.

  Method: GET
  Path: /google-calendar/callback/
  Source: integrations.google_calendar.views.GoogleCalendarCallbackView
  Auth: None (public).
}
